            XXL Mr. Mime is a size variant that is larger than
            the ordinary size range. Size does not automatically
            mean higher IVs or stronger battle performance.

        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="size-card xxl">

        <strong>
            📏 XXL Mr. Mime
        </strong>

        <p>

            A large-sized Mr. Mime can be a valuable collection
            piece, particularly if it also has strong IVs or
            another special trait.

        </p>

    </div>


    <h3>
        Does XXL Make Mr. Mime Stronger?
    </h3>

    <p>

        No. XXL status is primarily a size and collection
        characteristic. Do not assume that an XXL Pokémon has
        better IVs or greater combat power simply because of
        its size.

    </p>


    <ul class="checklist">

        <li>
            Keep an XXL Mr. Mime if you enjoy size collecting.
        </li>

        <li>
            Check its IV appraisal separately.
        </li>

        <li>
            Compare its size with your other Mr. Mime catches.
        </li>

        <li>
            Consider keeping an XXL specimen with a rare
            additional trait.
        </li>

    </ul>

