        <h2>
            Mr. Mime Evolution
        </h2>

    </div>


    <p>

        In Pokémon GO, Mr. Mime is part of the Mr. Mime
        evolutionary family associated with Mime Jr. Mime Jr.
        can evolve into Mr. Mime when the required evolution
        conditions are met.

    </p>


    <div class="special-banner">

        <strong>
            Mime Jr. → Mr. Mime
        </strong>

        <p>

            Mr. Mime is the evolved form of Mime Jr. in the
            standard Kanto evolutionary family.

        </p>

    </div>


    <h3>
        Important Regional Detail
    </h3>

    <p>

        Mr. Mime is associated with regional availability,
        while Galarian Mr. Mime is a distinct regional form
        with different typing and evolution characteristics.
        Do not merge Kanto Mr. Mime and Galarian Mr. Mime
        into one database entry.

    </p>

</section>



